### Get all entries
GET http://localhost:3000/api/entries

### Get a random entry
GET http://localhost:3000/api/entries/random

### Create a gratitude entry
POST http://localhost:3000/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gratitude",
  "content": "I am grateful for having time to learn today."
}

### Create a compliment entry
POST http://localhost:3000/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "compliment",
  "content": "Someone told me that I was a good listener."
}

### Create a joyful-moment entry
POST http://localhost:3000/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "joyful-moment",
  "content": "I enjoyed feeling the sunshine on my face."
}

### Test validation: invalid category
POST http://localhost:3000/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "something-else",
  "content": "This request should return a validation error."
}

### Test validation: missing content
POST http://localhost:3000/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gratitude"
}

### Delete entry with ID 1
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/entries/1

### Test deletion of an unknown entry
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/entries/999